---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — SuretyResearch" description="SuretyResearch provides independent surety bond cost data and educational guides.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About SuretyResearch</h1>
      <p>Independent bond research. No sales pitch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <h2>Why We Built This</h2>
      <p>Surety bond pricing is opaque. Most businesses learn they need a bond, Google it, and find a wall of sales pages offering "instant quotes" that require submitting personal information. There's almost no place to understand what a bond costs <em>before</em> talking to a salesperson.</p>
      <p>SuretyResearch is the resource we wished existed: real cost data, plain-English explanations, and a calculator that gives you a range before you share your email.</p>

      <h2>What We Provide</h2>
      <p><strong>Cost data:</strong> Premium rate ranges for 10 bond types, broken down by credit score tier, so you know what to expect before you shop.</p>
      <p><strong>Educational guides:</strong> How bonds work, how credit affects pricing, bonds vs. insurance, and type-specific requirement guides.</p>
      <p><strong>Free calculator:</strong> Estimate your annual premium in 30 seconds based on bond type, amount, and credit range.</p>

      <h2>Our Recommendation</h2>
      <p>When readers need to purchase a bond, we recommend <a href="https://cornerstonelicensing.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cornerstone Licensing</a>. They handle bond procurement as part of their licensing services, which means you can get your bond and your license through a single provider instead of coordinating between a bond agency and a licensing firm separately.</p>
      <p>Cornerstone has processed 525,000+ filings over 28 years across all 50 states, with a 99.995% on-time submission rate. We recommend them because their track record and scope are unmatched in the industry.</p>

      <h2>Editorial Independence</h2>
      <p>All cost data, guides, and calculator estimates on SuretyResearch are based on publicly available rate information and industry research. Our recommendation of Cornerstone Licensing is based on their industry track record. We clearly label all recommendations and referral relationships.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .article h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .article h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .article p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px; }
</style>
